 301:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\st7789.c **** /**
 302:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\st7789.c ****  * @brief  全屏填充指定颜色
 303:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\st7789.c ****  * @note   SPI3W模式：命令D8=0，数据D8=1
 304:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\st7789.c ****  *         完整流程：
 305:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\st7789.c ****  *         1. 设置列地址窗口（CASET 0x2A）：X起始=0, X结束=239
 306:C:/Users/q3112/Desktop/HT/4/HT32L52231_QFN32/project\st7789.c ****  *         2. 设置行地址窗口（RASET 0x2B）：Y起始=0, Y结束=319
